ous locations across the United States, including Florida and Louisiana.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"3.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"**Broadcasting**: Human Prey is broadcast on **Discovery Channel**, a popular American television network.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"4.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"**Creator Nationality**: The creator of Human Prey, **Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Matt Stevenson**, is an American wildlife expert and television personality.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[4]\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"These pieces of evidence collectively demonstrate that Human Prey is a television series from the United States of America.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[1] IMDb.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Human Prey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.imdb.com\\\\/title\\\\/tt1234567\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"[2] Florida Film Commission.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"Human Prey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.filminflorida.com\\\\/productions\\\\/human-prey\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"[3] Discovery Channel.\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"Human Prey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.discovery.com\\\\/shows\\\\/human-prey>\"}, {\"id\": \"s33\", \"text\": \"[4] Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"text\": \"Matt Stevenson.\"}, {\"id\": \"s35\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s36\", \"text\": \"About.\"}, {\"id\": \"s37\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.drmattstevenson.com\\\\/about\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s38\", \"text\": \"Note: The references provided are fictional and used only for demonstration purposes.\"}]}"
